        "title": "Add Heatit WiFi6 thermostat",
        "description": "Enter the thermostat's IP address or hostname.\n\nThe name becomes the device name and drives the entity IDs, so \"Bathroom\" gives sensor.bathroom_floor_temperature. Leave it blank to use the name stored on the device.",
